{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～～ななせまる!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん最近何かとななせまる(西野七瀬chan)に絡む(//ω//)きゃは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん頑張ってななせまるの物まねしよるんぢゃけど\nみんないわくちょっと違うらしいんよねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃけななせまるによく「ななせまるの物まねをするひめたんの物まね」をされる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん(。・ω・。)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのうのひめたんブログ読んでなーいって人は→こっちこっち ひめたん(*ゝω･*)ﾉその55"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、年末に帰らなかったのは、今回の事が影響しているのでしょうか？\n帰らずにレッスン続けて見てどうですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん(ω)!\nいつもレッスン出れないから、長い休みくらいは毎日出席するしかー!みたいな。\n普段ひめたんがおうちで練習しとる間にみんなは先生からアドバイスもらっとるって考えたら\nぐーっと差ぁつけられとる気がしてうずうずしとったんよー。\nぢゃけ充実した冬休みになりましたとさ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さんの友達に応援されるって変な感じするかな？\nひめかちゃんがイイなら応援させて！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然うぇるかむ♪\n嬉しいです高山ですー(o>ω<o)\nきゃは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉は好き？長風呂派？何回も派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も派ー♪\n「２時間は粘ろう!」っていっつも思うんぢゃけど\n結局あっさり諦める(ω)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元パワー注入して、元気になったのかな？\nそれともファンの暖かい言葉でのりきったのかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーどっちも(o>ω<o)/\n地元に帰ってひめきゅんさんたちからのコメント読む。\n最強のタッグですねこれ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の記事でコメント遅くなっちゃってごめんなさい。\nひめたん、遅くなったコメントって読んでる？\n多分読んでないだろうなぁ!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでますよぉ∩^ω^∩\n何回も読む。読んで読んで読み直すんですもんー♪\nだから遅刻してもコメント書いてってくださいよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんって球技とか興味ある？\nテニスとか…（硬式）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テニス"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/tennis.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"する人かっこいいと思うガチで(*/ω＼*)\nあっ野球もサッカーももちろんかっこいい\n結局何かに一生懸命な人はかっこいいんですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂制服カーディガン、ブレザー、色分けはどうやって決めてるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさん(^^)\n一人ひとりのイメージに合わせて決めるそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウチらも乃木坂ふぁみりーに入ってるの？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当然っ!\n乃木坂46が大好きだーって人はみんな乃木坂ふぁみりー\nあなたもわたしも乃木坂ふぁみりー∩^ω^∩♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元パワーってひめたんのクラスには\nどんな人がいてはるん(^^)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのクラスは学年1やんちゃで元気でお説教の常連さん。\n38人全員空気が読めるみたいです。\nみーんな優しくて、個性的で、面白いんだこれが!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーそう。それでね今日はね。\n明治の記者会見がありましたとさ。\nゆーわけで近々明治ＣＭバージョンの制服解禁するかもしれないかもー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず今日のひめたんは自撮りしとったら、1っ収穫があった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラ設定で「人物」モードがあるにもかかわらず..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「夜景」モードがいい感じになる!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...はず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/13/himeka0048.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん(。・ω・。)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}